# Rule sizing: tile-like selectors that may set min-height / min-block-size. Format: <selector>   # reason (required: an
# entry without a reason is ignored). An entry matches only that exact selector, so keep it to a tile whose floor is part
# of its design, never a content tile (content tiles size to content).
.tile-error   # RES-09: a crashed tile keeps its slot with a 96 px floor, so the Today grid does not jump when it fails
.tile-header__link   # B9-44 (TB-09): the TileHeader's trailing link is not a tile but a 44 px link target ("Pantry ›"); its floor is the touch target
